      "note": "STAMP COMM expansion pads numbered TP1 through TP12 in the official schematic. TP7 is SYS_INT5V (system 5V), distinct from switched SYS_EXT5V on Grove/side header. GPIO31/32 share internal I2C; GPIO5/18/19 share SPI. Logical terminal order only; physical geometry is unverified.",
